    "identifier": "medical-release-strength-of-100",
    "description": "<p>You use finely controlled chakra across your body, granting you strength of over 100 people. You gain the following benefits;</p>\n<p>Your strength becomes 20 for the Duration.</p>\n<p>Your jump height and distance are doubled.</p>\n<p>You gain Advantage on Strength &amp; Constitution based ability checks, skill checks, and saves.</p>\n<p>Your [Unarmed damage Die] becomes 2d8.</p>\n<p>After you end this jutsu, you suffer the consequences of pushing your body to its limit. You gain disadvantage on Strength based ability and skill checks for the next hour or until you take a short rest.</p>",
